<title>USA: Armstrong SD, Pa., won by Prudential Securities.</title>
<headline>Armstrong SD, Pa., won by Prudential Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc said it won $17.440 million of Armstrong School District, Pa., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.157 percent.</p>
</text>
